{"id":"u152","kelas":"skill","no":3,"judul":"Temukan Kesalahan (1)","title":"Find the Mistake I","emoji":"🔍","ringkas":"Kesalahan tata bahasa dasar: to be, tense, artikel, jamak","ready":true,"goals":["menemukan **kalimat yang salah** di antara beberapa kalimat","mengenali kesalahan **to be, tense, artikel, dan bentuk jamak**","memeriksa **kesesuaian subjek dan kata kerja**","membiasakan diri **mengedit** tulisan sendiri"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Mengedit adalah bagian dari menulis. Pada latihan ini ada beberapa kalimat dan **satu** di antaranya mengandung kesalahan. Ketuk kalimat yang salah. Periksa subjek–kata kerja, tense, artikel, dan jamak."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Daftar periksa mengedit","table":[["Periksa","Pertanyaan","Contoh kesalahan"],["Subjek + kata kerja","Apakah cocok (tunggal/jamak)?","[[He go to school.]] → goes"],["Tense","Apakah sesuai penanda waktu?","[[Yesterday I go home.]] → went"],["To be","Apakah am/is/are tepat?","[[They is happy.]] → are"],["Artikel","a/an/the diperlukan?","[[She has a umbrella.]] → an"],["Jamak","Apakah kata benda jamak?","[[Two cat sleep.]] → cats"],["Kata kerja setelah do/did/modal","Bentuk dasar?","[[She did not went.]] → go"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Baca satu per satu","text":"Baca setiap kalimat dengan keras, perlahan. Telinga sering mendengar kesalahan sebelum mata menemukannya."},{"t":"summary","items":["Cek subjek dan kata kerja.","Cek tense dengan penanda waktu.","Cek a/an dan jamak.","Setelah did/can/will: kata kerja dasar."]}],"practice":[{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["My brother plays football every Sunday.","He have a new ball.","His team practises at the school field.","They always have fun."],"answer":1,"exp":"He → has.","k":"55e1a4f0"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["Yesterday we went to the beach.","The water was clean.","We swim for two hours.","Then we ate fish."],"answer":2,"exp":"Yesterday → swam.","k":"8d21b8af"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["Dina is a clever girl.","She speak three languages.","She wants to be a translator.","Her parents are proud of her."],"answer":1,"exp":"She → speaks.","k":"78fcd87c"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["There are two cats in my house.","One cat is black.","The other cat have white fur.","I love them both."],"answer":2,"exp":"cat → has.","k":"088fa9bc"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["Tom bought a umbrella yesterday.","It was raining.","He walked to school.","He arrived on time."],"answer":0,"exp":"umbrella → an umbrella.","k":"c80f4761"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["I am happy today.","My friends is here.","We are going to the park.","We will bring some snacks."],"answer":1,"exp":"friends are.","k":"c1a80ebb"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["She did not went to school yesterday.","She was sick.","Her mother called the teacher.","She stayed in bed."],"answer":0,"exp":"did not go.","k":"83e5b376"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["The children are playing outside.","They kicks a ball.","The sun is bright.","Their mother watches from the window."],"answer":1,"exp":"They kick.","k":"c5e5d3a3"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["Rani has two brothers.","Both of them are students.","One brother study in Bandung.","The other works in Jakarta."],"answer":2,"exp":"One brother studies.","k":"d71fe46a"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["It was a rainy day.","We stay at home.","We played cards and watched TV.","At night the rain stopped."],"answer":1,"exp":"stayed (lampau).","k":"4a066c03"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["I can swims very fast.","My sister is slower than me.","We swim in the pool every week.","The coach is happy."],"answer":0,"exp":"can swim.","k":"1d9c33b2"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["My mother is a nurse.","She works in a hospital.","She help many sick people.","Everyone respects her."],"answer":2,"exp":"She helps.","k":"f4647469"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["Budi wakes up at five o'clock.","He takes a shower.","He eat breakfast at six.","Then he goes to school."],"answer":2,"exp":"He eats.","k":"01d80490"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["This is my new phone.","It have a big screen.","The camera is very good.","I like it a lot."],"answer":1,"exp":"It has.","k":"068e0d12"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["Last week, Dina visit her grandmother.","They cooked lunch together.","Her grandmother told old stories.","Dina went home in the evening."],"answer":0,"exp":"visited.","k":"a94a1c9b"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["There is a lot of rice in the kitchen.","There are three eggs.","There is five oranges.","I will cook dinner."],"answer":2,"exp":"There are five oranges.","k":"1e422e07"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["My friend lives in Medan.","She have two sisters.","They study at the same school.","I visit them every year."],"answer":1,"exp":"She has.","k":"ef432a8f"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["The teacher gives us homework.","We does it at home.","We bring it to class.","He checks it carefully."],"answer":1,"exp":"We do.","k":"c6df3329"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["Tom and Rani is classmates.","They sit together.","They help each other.","They get good marks."],"answer":0,"exp":"are classmates.","k":"7709dc94"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["I have an English book.","I